    "function": "Toxic component of a type II toxin-antitoxin (TA) system. Has RNase activity (By similarity). Overexpression in M.tuberculosis or M.smegmatis inhibits colony formation in a bacteriostatic rather than bacteriocidal fashion. Its toxic effect is neutralized by coexpression with cognate antitoxin RelB (shown only for M.smegmatis)..; FUNCTION: In combination with RelB represses its own promoter. Has been seen to bind DNA in complex with cognate antitoxin RelB but not alone",
